	(text "Precharge and contactor"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "28bda69f-69a7-4898-8cf1-113ac0df18cf")
	)
	(text "Precharge relay + resistor, main contactor command, passive bleeder, active discharge. SPEC.md 7 - DECISIONS.md D013/D014/D016."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "33b52022-08fe-45e6-8329-608492dbfbce")
	)
	(text "K401: coil is in the LV 12 V domain, contacts switch the HV DC bus - the relay itself is the isolation barrier and must be rated\nfor it: HV DC precharge relay, >=450 V DC contact rating [TBV] (e.g. TE KILOVAC or Panasonic AEV class)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 32.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8d3ccc0d-5701-4009-8507-1a2c89c12fce")
	)
	(text "R401: E = 0.5*C*V^2 = 40.5 J (400 uF, 450 V) -> >=41 J, >=50 W pulse [TBV].\n(D013: 750 uF Si path -> 76 J; SiC chosen (D016), 400 uF stands.)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 85.09 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "282c51bf-7d07-4c25-acda-a1b20940f2d0")
	)
	(text "Main contactor is external to this board - only the coil command is generated here.\nCONTACTOR_P / CONTACTOR_N feed the external coil from +12 V, flyback-protected (SPEC 13). Closure only per SPEC 7.1 sequencing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 136.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b8da5d00-642a-42d9-893d-3d4b2efffff6")
	)
	(text "Passive bleeder: series string, >=4 resistors per SPEC 8.2 - no single part may span 450 V.\n4x 18.7k = 74.8k -> tau = 30 s (SPEC 7.2); 2.7 W total at 450 V, ~0.68 W per part -> 3 W parts [TBV]."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 37.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dccbd164-ac97-4f73-a756-6be3ed6d361e")
	)
	(text "Active discharge (SPEC 7.2): R421-R424, 4x 220R = 880R, in series with Q403 (C3M0350120J, 1200 V SiC).\n~0.51 A initial at 450 V, ~230 W initial pulse for <5 s - single-shot thermal rating [TBV], not continuous.\nSeries string per SPEC 8.2 - no single resistor spans 450 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210.82 55.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "47145e53-b3ae-4032-ad4e-b9eeef7c8dba")
	)
	(text "VOM1271 photovoltaic drive — no supply needed; ~10 s-class turn-on at µA charge currents is acceptable for discharge duty;\nRds elevated at ~8 V VGS (not spec'd below 11 V) — verified acceptable for current-limited single-shot duty (D022 research)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195.58 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a42a2bb9-7d8e-4939-ab6a-0355f5ee8396")
	)
	(text "SPEC 7.1 sequencing rule:\n\"precharge relay closes -> bus monitored -> main contactor closes only when V_bus >= 95% of supply -> precharge relay\nopens. The MCU commands both; neither may close without a valid bus voltage reading.\""
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "105a055d-df99-497e-8c10-131259973424")
	)
	(text "SPEC 7.2 discharge requirements:\n  Passive bleeder:   < 60 V within 60 s            | 75k across bus -> tau = 30 s; 2.7 W at 450 V\n  Active discharge:  < 60 V within 5 s, commanded  | switched resistor, thermally rated for single-shot"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1ebb7ed9-f990-4e22-a2aa-9d84d591400e")
	)
